</blockquote><p data-structure="Section" id="p_44"><span class="citetext" data-sentiment="Pos" data-docid="28868630" id="span_53">22.      According to the judgment of this court <a href="/doc/28868630/" id="a_73">K. Shashidhar v. Indian Overseas
