<blockquote id="blockquote_97">       “56. <a href="/doc/77957879/" id="a_196">Section 48</a> of the GVAT Act is not contrary to or inconsistent with <a href="/doc/84453334/" id="a_197">Section
       53</a> or any other provisions of the IBC. Under <a href="/doc/151158449/" id="a_198">Section 53(1)(b)(ii)</a>, the debts
